00:09:51.296 --> 00:09:55.327
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:09:55.927 --> 00:10:04.879
<v Slow>三菱UFJの時価総額は、7月13日にどうなりましたか。

00:10:05.679 --> 00:10:08.823
<v Host>It became number one in Japan for the first time.

00:10:09.423 --> 00:10:17.464
<v Slow>三菱UFJの時価総額は、およそいくらになりましたか。

00:10:18.264 --> 00:10:20.495
<v Host>About forty-two trillion yen.

00:10:21.096 --> 00:10:26.471
