00:10:27.272 --> 00:10:31.327
<v Host>A stronger view that interest rates in Japan will rise.

00:10:31.927 --> 00:10:52.111
<v Host>That's all for today. Japan's largest bank group topped every other company by market value for the first time, passing Toyota, as rising interest rates lifted hopes for bigger bank profits. Many say it marks a turning point after decades led by manufacturers. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

00:10:52.711 --> 00:10:55.111
<v News>また明日。
